        "controller_support": "full",
        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3905680/extras/bb3c923a7d23863842a629d4a4d41e5e.avif?t=1755168777\" width=1600 height=308 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🟣 Méli-Mélo 4: The Odyssey of Chestnut Cream 🟣</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Four friends, a jar of chestnut cream, an unlikely quest.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bigflo</strong>, <strong>Oli</strong>, <strong>Mcfly</strong> &amp; <strong>Carlito</strong> are stuck on the set of Méli-Mélo, but an essential ingredient has disappeared... chestnut cream!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dive into an original 2D platformer and help our four heroes recover it, level after level.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🎮 Game features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🧩 Discover several unique levels, full of surprises and references.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🔁 Vary the style of play with a change of character at each level.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🧠 Face amazing mini-bosses and overcome unexpected obstacles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >⏱️ Challenge your friends in speedrun mode: who will finish the fastest?</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But beware... behind this theft lies an enemy well known to the four friends... and he's greedier than ever!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🧃 Did you know?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Méli-Mélo is a YouTube video concept created by the duos <strong>Mcfly</strong> &amp; <strong>Carlito</strong> and <strong>Bigflo</strong> &amp; <strong>Oli</strong>, in which they have fun surprising each other in a series of mini-games and happenings straight out of the minds of each member of the quartet.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Since episode 3, a mysterious jar of chestnut cream has been making an appearance. In episode 4, the surprise is revealed: this jar gives access to a... video game!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>🎓 A game imagined by Carlito and developed by students at the Gaming Campus school in Lyon.</i></p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3905680/extras/bb3c923a7d23863842a629d4a4d41e5e.avif?t=1755168777\" width=1600 height=308 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🟣 Méli-Mélo 4: The Odyssey of Chestnut Cream 🟣</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Four friends, a jar of chestnut cream, an unlikely quest.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bigflo</strong>, <strong>Oli</strong>, <strong>Mcfly</strong> &amp; <strong>Carlito</strong> are stuck on the set of Méli-Mélo, but an essential ingredient has disappeared... chestnut cream!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dive into an original 2D platformer and help our four heroes recover it, level after level.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🎮 Game features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🧩 Discover several unique levels, full of surprises and references.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🔁 Vary the style of play with a change of character at each level.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🧠 Face amazing mini-bosses and overcome unexpected obstacles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >⏱️ Challenge your friends in speedrun mode: who will finish the fastest?</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But beware... behind this theft lies an enemy well known to the four friends... and he's greedier than ever!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🧃 Did you know?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Méli-Mélo is a YouTube video concept created by the duos <strong>Mcfly</strong> &amp; <strong>Carlito</strong> and <strong>Bigflo</strong> &amp; <strong>Oli</strong>, in which they have fun surprising each other in a series of mini-games and happenings straight out of the minds of each member of the quartet.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Since episode 3, a mysterious jar of chestnut cream has been making an appearance. In episode 4, the surprise is revealed: this jar gives access to a... video game!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>🎓 A game imagined by Carlito and developed by students at the Gaming Campus school in Lyon.</i></p>",
        "short_description": "Bigflo, Oli, and McFly &amp; Carlito must find a mysterious jar of chestnut cream in a crazy 2D platform game! Switch heroes at each level, face mini-bosses, and embark on a speedrun!",
